module examples.err_layout_runtime_unimplemented

# plans/M10.md item A, decision 561: 03-hardware.md §3.1's fourth layout
# kind is normative from the moment its wording lands, and unimplemented
# until item A2 lands the field types it is defined in terms of (nested
# `@layout(runtime)` structs and fixed-length arrays of one). It parses —
# so the closed set every other `@layout` diagnostic advertises is the
# truth — and is then refused. It is never silently accepted and checked
# against rules written for the other three kinds.
#
# Note what this file does *not* contain: an array field or a nested
# layout field. Those are item A2's own rejections, and pinning them here
# would pin the wrong reason.

@layout(runtime, endian=little)
struct TurnArea:
    state: u32
    waiter: u32
